# Wisdom ERP — Sprint 2 Interactive Build Report ✅
### Pricabe Enterprises (Pvt) Ltd

The app is live at **http://localhost:3000**

---

## What Was Built in Sprint 2

We upgraded the application from a view-only data presentation layer to an **interactive ERP** system. 
This was achieved by introducing Next.js Server Actions and wiring them to Client Component Modals for the core operations.

### New Interactive Capabilities:

| Module | New Features |
|---|---|
| **Global UI** | Smooth, sliding `Modal` component and top-right `Toast` notification system. Sidebar user `SettingsPanel` sliding drawer. |
| **Agriculture** | Form to start a `+ New Cycle` — dynamically linked to Farm and Crop records. |
| **Livestock** | Form to register a `+ New Batch` of animals and `+ Log Event` (Births, Deaths, Sales, Treatments) which automatically updates head counts and cost logs. |
| **Inventory** | Functional `+ Add Stock` form updating weighted average costs, `+ Stock Transfer` form moving items between farm warehouses, and `+ Log Delivery` for fuel tanks. |
| **Purchasing** | Complex `+ New PO` form with dynamic line items (add/remove rows, auto-calculating totals). `Approve` button for pending orders. |
| **Sales** | `+ New Invoice` form with dynamic line items. Allows assigning sales to different outlets (Butchery, Bar, Retail, etc.). |
| **Manufacturing** | `+ New Production Run` form connecting BOMs to Target Quantities. |
| **Fixed Assets** | `+ Register Asset` form for auto-calculating straight-line depreciation. |
| **CRM / Address Book**| `+ Add Contact` / `+ Add Customer` forms supporting CRM and supplier pipelines. |
| **Setup** | `+ Add Farm`, `+ Add Account` for global multi-entity configuration. |

